 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully updated 4-bedroom, 4-bath (2 full, 2 half) Colonial in Norwalk's highly desirable Wolfpit neighborhood!  Inside, a welcoming foyer with 9-foot ceilings introduces hardwood floors that flow seamlessly throughout the main level. The open layout connects a living room to a family room with a gas fireplace. The chef's kitchen features a gas cooktop island, double wall ovens, and a convenient mudroom leading directly to the 2-car garage.  Upstairs, the primary suite offers two walk-in closets and a spa-like bath. Three more spacious bedrooms-including one with a private half-bath-share a stunning hall bath with heated floors.  The expansive walk-out lower level features high ceilings and French doors, providing over 1,100 sqft of incredible versatile bonus space-perfect for a bedroom, recreation area, or office setup.  Step outside through glass sliders to your private outdoor oasis. Entertain easily on the recently renovated deck and enjoy the brand-new backyard hardscaping, all surrounded by lush evergreen privacy screening.",
